    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Graduates of the Aga Khan University Medical College (AKU-MC), will now be eligible to apply for medical registration in Singapore, following a landmark decision by Singapore's Ministry of Health (MOH) and the Singapore Medical Council (SMC). The recognition, effective February 1, places AKU among eight additional overseas medical schools whose graduates are permitted to practise medicine in the country, subject to prevailing regulatory requirements.",
